    "roadmapStatusesAllowed": [
      "Planned"
    ],
    "bodyScrollWidthAssertion": "PER-ELEMENT: no element's bounding rect may exceed the viewport (right <= clientWidth+1, left >= -1), excluding aria-hidden subtrees. DO NOT use documentElement.scrollWidth === clientWidth: overflow-x:hidden on the root pins those two values together, making that a tautology that cannot fail. It reported PASS at all four breakpoints while section 02 destroyed 58% of its own text (QA BLOCKING-1). Mutation-tested: green at HEAD, red with the defect re-injected.",
    "forbiddenStringsNote": "The single entry is a sentinel, not the literal. The community-source name banned by ratified decision Q4 is deliberately absent from this repository so that the repository passes its own case-insensitive scan; the QA harness (qa/harness/run-content.mjs) reconstructs the pattern at runtime. See docs/REDACTIONS.md."
